# Native PC ports / recomps (Dr. Mario 64, etc.) - downloaded executables and
# assets, the same reasoning as cores/bios/roms above: large third-party
# binaries that do not belong in the repo. port_runner.cpp/.h are the code
# that manages this folder and are tracked normally; only its contents are not.
/app/ports/
/ports/
**/ports/

